    "report_markdown": "# Hypora run report: run_26cecb18d9c1\n\n**Outcome:** a verified model.\n\n## Task\n- Objective: Identify which website sessions will end in a purchase based on session characteristics.\n- Target: `Revenue` (binary_classification)\n- Primary metric: `roc_auc` (maximize)\n\n## Summary\nThe objective was to identify which website sessions will end in a purchase based on session characteristics. Several models were tried, starting with a baseline logistic regression and advancing to tuned gradient boosting classifiers. The final model delivered achieved a test roc_auc of 0.9312 and a validation roc_auc of 0.9254.\n\n**Observations**\n- The histogram gradient boosting model outperformed the baseline logistic regression pipeline on validation scores.\n- Tuning learning rate and maximum iterations yielded the best performing candidate.\n- The final model maintained consistent performance across cross-validation folds.\n- Leakage candidates were flagged during screening and require methodological review.\n\n**Limitations**\n- Leakage candidates were flagged among the screened features, so potential data leakage cannot be ruled out.\n- The evaluation relies on the specified split strategy and may vary on out-of-time data samples.\n- Class imbalance affects metrics like recall and precision, which are lower than overall accuracy.\n\n_Written by the Reporter; every number above is filled in from stored metrics._\n\n## Final model\n- Trial `trl_0ee67c21`: Tuning learning_rate and max_iter for HistGradientBoostingClassifier may slightly improve validation roc_auc.\n- Verified: yes\n\n| Metric | Test (once) | Validation (mean) |\n|---|---|---|\n| roc_auc | 0.9312 | 0.9254 |\n| accuracy | 0.8989 | 0.8991 |\n| balanced_accuracy | 0.7659 | 0.7673 |\n| precision | 0.7162 | 0.7168 |\n| recall | 0.5734 | 0.5764 |\n| f1 | 0.6369 | 0.6388 |\n| precision_macro | 0.8204 | 0.8210 |\n| recall_macro | 0.7659 | 0.7673 |\n| f1_macro | 0.7891 | 0.7901 |\n| pr_auc | 0.7374 | 0.7261 |\n| log_loss | 0.2267 | 0.2364 |\n| brier_score | 0.0710 | 0.0730 |\n\n| Check | Status | Detail |\n|---|---|---|\n| allowed_features | passed | trial code received exactly the contract's allowed features |\n| split_respected | passed | stratified split: disjoint, complete |\n| test_labels_not_accessed | passed | every predict stage saw features and the model only |\n| output_shape | passed | one prediction per planned row, task-shaped columns |\n| finite_outputs | passed | all predictions finite and well-formed |\n| metric_recomputation | passed | recomputed metrics match the harness |\n| artifact_loads | passed | the frozen model loaded in a sandbox and predicted the test split |\n| resource_limits | passed | every stage completed inside the submitted job's limits |\n| learned_transform_leakage | skipped | static analysis of fit/predict arrives with verifier v2 (S3.C4) |\n\n## Trials\n| Trial | Kind | Status | Validation roc_auc (mean \u00b1 std, folds) | Hypothesis |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `trl_0ee67c21` | candidate | verified | 0.9254 \u00b1 0.0033 (3) | Tuning learning_rate and max_iter for HistGradientBoostingClassifier may slightly improve validation roc_auc. |\n| `trl_1ec704cf` | candidate | validated | 0.9230 \u00b1 0.0026 (3) | HistGradientBoostingClassifier can model non-linear relationships and interactions among numerical and categorical features. |\n| `trl_e50ed562` | baseline | validated | 0.8889 \u00b1 0.0033 (3) | Baseline logistic regression pipeline on all features. |\n\n## Data\n- Split: stratified, 20% test, stratified_kfold_3\n- Features used: 17; excluded: none\n- Leakage screen: Leakage candidates flagged: 1 among 17 screened features; methodological review is required.\n\n## Decision and faults\n- Decision: train (approved_plan)\n\n## Run notes\n- Stage-1 placeholder (D-019): contract built by code, plan approved by policy; replaced by the Data Lead (S3.A2) and the plan gate (S3.D2).\n- The agent finished after 16 model turns,